  "answer_text": "**ProFed Credit Union** (legally known as ProFed Federal Credit Union) is a member-owned, community-chartered financial institution based in Northeast Indiana. \n\n### Key Information & Contact Details\n* **Official Website:** [www.profedcreditunion.com](https://www.profedcreditunion.com) (also accessible via [profedcu.org](https://profedcu.org))\n* **Routing Number (ABA):** `274973183` (used for direct deposits, ACH transfers, and wire transfers)\n* **Main Branch/Headquarters Address:** 1710 St. Joe River Drive, Fort Wayne, IN 46805\n* **Mailing Address:** P.O. Box 5466, Fort Wayne, IN 46895-5466\n* **General Phone Number:** 260-483-0514 or toll-free at 800-752-4613\n\n### Membership Eligibility\nBecause ProFed is a community-chartered credit union, membership is open to anyone who lives, works, worships, regularly conducts business, or volunteers in the following nine Northeast Indiana counties:\n* Adams, Allen, DeKalb, Huntington, LaGrange, Noble, Steuben, Wells, and Whitley.\n\n### Services Provided\nProFed offers a full suite of personal and commercial banking services, including:\n* **Personal Banking:** Checking and savings accounts, certificates of deposit (CDs), and IRAs.\n* **Loans:** Auto loans, mortgages, home equity lines of credit (HELOCs), and personal loans.\n* **Credit Cards:** Visa\u00ae Rewards and standard credit card options.\n* **Business Services:** Commercial checking/savings, business loans, and lines of credit.\n* **Digital Banking:** Online banking, e-statements, bill pay, and mobile apps available for both Apple iOS and Google Android devices.\n* **Financial Advising:** Investment and retirement planning through ProFed Financial Advisors.\n\n***Security Reminder:** To log in to your account, check your balance, or perform transactions, always navigate directly to their official secure website or use their official mobile app. Never share your online banking passwords, PINs, or Social Security numbers in unofficial chat windows or emails.*",
